        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MDHF25, Flush Magnetic Door Stop and Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn elegantly styled magnet door stop and holder, the Deltana MDHF25 Flush Magnetic Door Stop is great to use when you need a very low profile floor mounted base to reduce the risk of potential tripping or to ease floor cleaning. The round strike plate is 2-3/8 inches in diameter and mounts flush on the floor. The magnet is screwed on bottom of the door. When the magnet approaches the strike, an arm raises up to 3/4 inch to stop and hold the door. Packaged complete with mounting anchors and matching finish mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MDHF25U-specifications.gif?v=1704354768\" width\"600\" height=\"220\" border=\"0\" atl=\" Flush Mounted Magnet Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana MDHF25 Flush Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Strike Base Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Base Height: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Base Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Base Height: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Magnet Base Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Clearance to Strike: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>The magnet must be mounted within 3/4\" of the strike plate. If the bottom of your door has more than 3/4\" of gap to the floor it will NOT work properly.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MDHF25.pdf?v=1691095374\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana MDHF25 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a> </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged complete with mounting anchors and matching finish mounting screws. \r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Flush Magnetic Door Stop",
                "description": "Flush Magnetic Door Stop and Holder, Deltana MDHF25 - An elegantly styled magnet door stop and holder, the Deltana MDHF25 Flush Magnetic Door Stop is great to use when you need a very low profile floor mounted base to reduce the risk of potential tripping or to ease floor cleaning. The round strike plate is 2-3/8 inches in diameter and mounts flush on the floor. The magnet is screwed on bottom of the door. When the magnet approaches the strike, an arm raises up to 3/4 inch to stop and hold the door. Packaged complete with mounting anchors and matching finish mounting screws.",
